Answer: Based on the claim origin URL title — "These 12 Graphs Show Mask Mandates Do Nothing to Stop COVID" — Yinon Weiss was presenting and refuting the claim rather than asserting it. The search result does not directly address his position on masks, but it consistently portrays him as "lockdown-skeptical" and critical of pandemic-related public health measures, which aligns with the refutation interpretation suggested by the article's headline.

